    <div>
        <div class="help-section-h">▶ <span class="h-sec-en">READ THE SCREEN</span><span class="h-sec-ko">화면 읽기</span></div>
        <div class="help-steps">
            <div class="help-step ok">
                <div class="help-step-num">1</div>
                <div class="help-step-body">
                    <div class="help-step-en"><strong>Part grid</strong> — every part registered to this station (BOP) with today's PLAN / INPUT / NG / FINAL. Tap a row to select it; the open work order for that part is picked automatically — there is no WO acceptance step.</div>
                    <div class="help-step-ko"><strong>품번 그리드</strong> — 이 스테이션 BOP 에 등록된 품번과 당일 계획/투입/불량/양품. 행을 누르면 선택되고 그 품번의 열린 작업지시가 자동으로 잡힌다 — WO 접수 단계는 없다.</div>
                    <div class="help-step-hint">NO WO = no released work order for this part · NOT IN BOP = produced today but not registered</div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="help-step">
                <div class="help-step-num">2</div>
                <div class="help-step-body">
                    <div class="help-step-en"><strong>Scan</strong> — scan the lot label to confirm the result. The banner shows SUCCESS / FAIL with the part and the work order the result was posted to; the grid selection follows the scanned part.</div>
                    <div class="help-step-ko"><strong>스캔</strong> — 라벨을 스캔하면 실적이 확정된다. 배너에 성공/실패와 실적이 올라간 품번·작업지시가 뜨고, 그리드 선택은 스캔한 품번으로 따라간다.</div>
                    <div class="help-step-hint">Chips: today good / defect rate / unconfirmed / NG blocked / mold shots — all for the selected part</div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="help-step dim">
                <div class="help-step-num">3</div>
                <div class="help-step-body">
                    <div class="help-step-en"><strong>Unconfirmed lots</strong> — labels printed but not yet scanned (newest first); 🖨 reprints a label. <strong>Scan history</strong> lists today's scans on this terminal.</div>
                    <div class="help-step-ko"><strong>미확정 로트</strong> — 라벨은 나왔지만 아직 스캔 안 된 LOT(최신순), 🖨 는 재출력. <strong>스캔 이력</strong>은 이 터미널의 오늘 스캔.</div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="help-step warn">
                <div class="help-step-num">4</div>
                <div class="help-step-body">
                    <div class="help-step-en"><strong>Buttons</strong> — MANUAL issues lots by hand when the PLC missed shots (scan the printed labels to confirm), DEFECT registers defects, ANDON raises a call. MANUAL and DEFECT need a selected part with an open WO.</div>
                    <div class="help-step-ko"><strong>버튼</strong> — 수동입력은 PLC 누락 시 LOT 을 손으로 발행(라벨을 스캔해야 확정), 불량 등록, 안돈 호출. 수동입력·불량은 열린 WO 가 있는 품번이 선택돼 있어야 한다.</div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="help-section-h">▶ <span class="h-sec-en">HOW THE NUMBERS WORK</span><span class="h-sec-ko">숫자 읽는 법</span></div>
        <div class="help-steps">
            <div class="help-step">
                <div class="help-step-num">=</div>
                <div class="help-step-body">
                    <div class="help-step-en"><strong>INPUT = FINAL + NG + unconfirmed.</strong> INPUT counts every lot created today for the part on this line; FINAL is scanned-good; NG is robot-NG lots plus manual defects; the rest is still waiting for a scan. PLAN comes from today's line schedule (PP-03).</div>
                    <div class="help-step-ko"><strong>투입 = 양품 + 불량 + 미확정.</strong> 투입은 오늘 이 라인에서 그 품번으로 생성된 LOT 전량, 양품은 스캔 확정분, 불량은 로봇 NG LOT + 수동 등록 불량, 나머지가 아직 스캔 대기. 계획은 오늘 라인 일정(PP-03)에서 온다.</div>
                    <div class="help-step-hint">Day boundary = lot creation time, not scan time</div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="help-callout warn">
            <div class="help-callout-i">⚠</div>
            <div class="help-callout-tx">
                <span class="h-call-en"><strong>Empty grid?</strong> This station has no parts in BOP (MD-005) — ask the planner. A red strip under the grid header means the last data refresh failed; the numbers shown are from the previous refresh.</span><span class="h-call-ko"><strong>그리드가 비었으면</strong> 이 스테이션의 BOP(MD-005) 품번이 없는 것 — 생산계획 담당에게. 그리드 헤더 아래 빨간 줄은 마지막 데이터 갱신 실패 표시이며 숫자는 직전 갱신값이다.</span>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
